		{"id":"9b53cbe372115d03","type":"text","text":"Les verbe modo, on ne met rien pas de **to** ni **ing**.  \nexp \"I can hear you\"","x":-289,"y":120,"width":338,"height":114,"color":"#9e94d1"},
